From 6ce3f59fdf710341ee9293abc59d16b1a7ee8d97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@aol.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:01:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 40/55] ntdll: Add WineForge's verified PE patch framework.

From WineForge: byte patches for native (never builtin) modules, applied after load and
verified against the expected bytes. Carries the Ubisoft Connect libcef command-line gate
(i386, runs under WoW64). The Steam overlay patch for D3DMetal's dxgi.dll is left out:
D3DMetal is x86_64-only and cannot run in an arm64 Wine.
---
